---
// FeatureGrid.astro - 6 Core Value Pillar Cards (Clean professional SaaS)
---

<section id="features-section" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-slate-200 bg-white dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f5f5f5] border border-[#ebebeb] text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#4d4d4d] mb-3 dark:bg-neutral-800/60 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-400">
        <span>Engineered for Perfection</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4 dark:text-white">
        Everything you need to bill like a top agency.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-500 leading-relaxed dark:text-neutral-400">
        Packed with pro billing capabilities that make invoicing effortless, compliant, and beautifully polished.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Feature 1: Digital Signature Studio -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-[#171717] hover:shadow-level-3 transition-all group dark:bg-[#111] dark:border-neutral-800 dark:hover:border-neutral-600">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#171717] text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform dark:bg-white dark:text-[#171717]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 dark:text-neutral-100">Digital Signature Studio</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed dark:text-neutral-400">
          Sign invoices right on your screen. Draw with a pressure-smooth pen, type in 4 elegant cursive fonts, or upload your scanned PNG signature.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Payment QR Codes -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-[#171717] hover:shadow-level-3 transition-all group dark:bg-[#111] dark:border-neutral-800 dark:hover:border-neutral-600">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#171717] text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform dark:bg-white dark:text-[#171717]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4v1m6 11h2m-6 0h-2v4m0-11v3m0 0h.01M12 12h4.01M16 20h4M4 12h4m12 0h.01M5 8h2a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1H5a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1zm12 0h2a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1h-2a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1zM5 20h2a1 1 0 001-1v-2a1 1 0 00-1-1H5a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 dark:text-neutral-100">Instant Payment QR Engine</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed dark:text-neutral-400">
          Stamp instant scannable QR codes onto your invoices. Supports Indian UPI (GPay, PhonePe, Paytm), European SEPA/IBAN, PayPal, and custom links.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Smart Tax & GST Engine -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-[#171717] hover:shadow-level-3 transition-all group dark:bg-[#111] dark:border-neutral-800 dark:hover:border-neutral-600">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#171717] text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform dark:bg-white dark:text-[#171717]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 dark:text-neutral-100">Multi-Currency & Tax Engine</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed dark:text-neutral-400">
          Supports 160+ world currencies, automatic conversion of amounts into words, CGST + SGST, IGST for interstate, VAT, Sales Tax, and discount models.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Local Storage Privacy Vault -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-[#171717] hover:shadow-level-3 transition-all group dark:bg-[#111] dark:border-neutral-800 dark:hover:border-neutral-600">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#171717] text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform dark:bg-white dark:text-[#171717]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 dark:text-neutral-100">100% Client-Side Privacy</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed dark:text-neutral-400">
          Your invoices, client names, and billing records are stored locally in your browser's private vault. No cloud servers, no tracking, complete data privacy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5: 1-Click Multi-Doc Morphing -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-[#171717] hover:shadow-level-3 transition-all group dark:bg-[#111] dark:border-neutral-800 dark:hover:border-neutral-600">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#171717] text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform dark:bg-white dark:text-[#171717]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7v8a2 2 0 002 2h6M8 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h4.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l4.414 4.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V15a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2M8 7H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2v-2" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 dark:text-neutral-100">1-Click Multi-Document Formats</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed dark:text-neutral-400">
          Transform any invoice into a Quotation / Estimate, Proforma Invoice, Payment Receipt, Purchase Order, or Credit Note with a single dropdown selection.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6: Vector PDF & Direct WhatsApp -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-[#171717] hover:shadow-level-3 transition-all group dark:bg-[#111] dark:border-neutral-800 dark:hover:border-neutral-600">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#171717] text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform dark:bg-white dark:text-[#171717]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 dark:text-neutral-100">High-Res Vector PDF & Sharing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed dark:text-neutral-400">
          Export crisp 300 DPI vector PDFs ready for printing or email attachments. Plus 1-click WhatsApp message formatting for rapid client follow-ups.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>